WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.299 --> 00:00:06.330
Qinghai Lake, the largest lake in China, is
one of the most secure locations the SCP Foundation

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:08.590
has ever taken control of.

00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:13.420
All available military assets have been gathered
at the site, including three of the most elite

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:17.100
Mobile Task Force units with experimental
weaponry.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:23.169
SCP-4290 must not be allowed to open, and
the site has been surrounded by nuclear mines

00:00:23.169 --> 00:00:26.710
and targeted with the Dagaz-Break Orbital
Strike System.

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:31.989
The perimeter cannot be breached, even if
it means the complete annihilation of the

00:00:31.989 --> 00:00:33.440
entire area.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:37.829
This is considered to be an acceptable loss
for the Foundation, since the destruction

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:42.630
that would be caused by taking such an extreme
measure is far from the worst-case scenario

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:45.070
when it comes to SCP-4290.

00:00:45.070 --> 00:00:51.140
That’s because the entity contained within
SCP-4290’s site has the potential to create

00:00:51.140 --> 00:00:53.760
a true end-of-the-world scenario.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:58.399
The Foundation, of course, is no stranger
to such situations, and even has a set of

00:00:58.399 --> 00:01:04.610
designations for the various types of apocalypses
like CK-Class restructuring scenarios and

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:08.140
ZK-Class “End of Reality” scenarios.

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:12.140
And since dealing with the end of the world
is nothing new for the Foundation, certain

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:15.440
precautions have been taken at the 4290 site.

00:01:15.440 --> 00:01:20.360
If containment measures fail, selected Foundation
personnel and civilians will be taken into

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:25.390
nearby emergency shelters that will hopefully
survive the chaos that would occur following

00:01:25.390 --> 00:01:26.390
a breach.

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:30.500
And the Foundation assumed that there was
a good chance this plan would have to be used

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:35.750
at some point, since at the time these precautions
were put in place, it was impossible to know

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:39.290
the chance of successful long-term containment.

00:01:39.290 --> 00:01:45.590
But just what is the entity that is held within
the site of SCP-4290 that is capable of causing

00:01:45.590 --> 00:01:49.220
so much death and destruction on a major scale?

00:01:49.220 --> 00:01:50.700
They call it simply…

00:01:50.700 --> 00:01:52.080
“The Child”.

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:54.180
No one has ever seen the child.

00:01:54.180 --> 00:01:56.350
No one knows what this entity is.

00:01:56.350 --> 00:02:01.500
That’s because even setting aside all the
Foundation security, the site itself is still

00:02:01.500 --> 00:02:04.310
deeply protected, literally.

00:02:04.310 --> 00:02:09.160
Over a hundred feet below the surface of Qinghai
lake, a stunning collection of relics can

00:02:09.160 --> 00:02:10.160
be found.

00:02:10.160 --> 00:02:15.350
The site is thaumaturgically sealed with eight
massive metal totems made of Beryllium and

00:02:15.350 --> 00:02:18.280
Bronze, that resemble armored warriors.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:23.280
The statues are inscribed with runes and arranged
in a pattern designed to banish the entity

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:27.640
kept there and keep the seal on its prison
closed.

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:31.780
Archaeological evidence indicates that the
site has been there for a very long time,

00:02:31.780 --> 00:02:36.410
and it is still active, with the center of
the site periodically emitting bursts of red

00:02:36.410 --> 00:02:37.410
light.

00:02:37.410 --> 00:02:40.980
But lately, the bursts have suddenly started
getting brighter.

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:46.380
You may be wondering how we know so much about
SCP-4290, and that it’s a site designed

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:51.020
to keep something sealed if it’s been deep
in a lake, quietly doing its job?

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:58.120
The SCP Foundation has access to unusual sources,
including SCP-1726, and it’s from there

00:02:58.120 --> 00:03:01.319
that we learned the little we know about SCP-429.

00:03:01.319 --> 00:03:09.071
SCP-1726 is a library in China that appears
to only be one floor from the outside, but

00:03:09.071 --> 00:03:13.250
on the inside covers over fourteen square
kilometers in area.

00:03:13.250 --> 00:03:18.140
It’s full of a seemingly limitless amount
of texts, many of which describe ancient and

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:23.840
lost civilizations, along with some clues
as to what led to the fall of these cultures.

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:27.980
One text revealed the presence of a terrible
and apparently unstoppable enemy.

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:32.780
It was called the Child - but it was anything
but innocent.

00:03:32.780 --> 00:03:38.110
When these texts were translated, what Foundation
researchers discovered terrified them.

00:03:38.110 --> 00:03:42.950
They described the emergence of a beast with
ten terrible mouths and twenty arms stretched

00:03:42.950 --> 00:03:43.950
wide.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:48.080
It was attacked by an army of warriors, but
they were quickly overwhelmed by what was

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:52.650
described as “torrents of darkness” and
“Dead geometries”.

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:57.700
They were killed, brutally, and the child
used its skeletal fingers to unleash a torrent

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.000
of flame.

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:04.890
Every soul in the vicinity was consumed, wax
rained from the sky, and the Child devoured

00:04:04.890 --> 00:04:10.420
everything around it for ten days - as the
whole world trembled.

00:04:10.420 --> 00:04:15.380
But then something sealed the Child away in
its prison which is now covered by the waters

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:16.940
of Qinghai Lake.

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:21.159
Soon ominous signs began to appear that the
Child would awaken again though.

00:04:21.159 --> 00:04:26.469
One day, televisions in the nearby area all
suddenly stopped playing their regular programming

00:04:26.469 --> 00:04:32.319
and began to show images of SCP-4290, with
a mysterious voice coming on over the images

00:04:32.319 --> 00:04:35.830
saying “Repair the Child’s Locks”.

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:40.849
This became more and more frequent, and the
tone of the voice became more worried, eventually

00:04:40.849 --> 00:04:44.499
saying “There is little time left”.

00:04:44.499 --> 00:04:49.449
Further investigations of the location revealed
the location of the mysterious mechanism that

00:04:49.449 --> 00:04:55.509
kept the chamber sealed, which was designated
as SCP-4290-LOCK.

00:04:55.509 --> 00:04:58.879
But how do you repair a device that is eons
old?

00:04:58.879 --> 00:05:03.500
And should you even be fixing it when the
one telling you to do it is a mysterious,

00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:07.050
disembodied voice that only appears on pirated
television broadcasts?

00:05:07.050 --> 00:05:12.749
The Foundation scrambled to find any information
they could, and they were able to find clues

00:05:12.749 --> 00:05:17.740
about the history of SCP-4290 referenced in
other texts.

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:22.639
Lost civilizations like the Xia Dynasty, the
Erikeshans, and the ancient Ortothans had

00:05:22.639 --> 00:05:27.680
apparently strengthened the seals during their
own reigns, but the most significant findings

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:32.740
indicated a connection to one of the most
terrifying entities the SCP Foundation had

00:05:32.740 --> 00:05:36.460
ever contained - and one of the most unpredictable.

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:38.479
The Daevite Empire.

00:05:38.479 --> 00:05:44.020
This mysterious, warlike civilization has
only been known through one source - SCP-140,

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:48.620
a single hardcopy book titled “A Chronicle
of the Daevas”.

00:05:48.620 --> 00:05:53.509
This is a strange, anomalous book that is
written in blood and is able to add more pages

00:05:53.509 --> 00:05:57.909
spontaneously to itself whenever it comes
in contact with any fluid that can be used

00:05:57.909 --> 00:06:02.089
for writing, but seems to especially prefer
human blood.

00:06:02.089 --> 00:06:06.180
It recounts the history of this civilization
and their many brutal conquests.

00:06:06.180 --> 00:06:10.809
While there was no proof of the Daevas before
this book was found, evidence paralleling

00:06:10.809 --> 00:06:15.159
the events written in the book is now being
found in archaeological digs.

00:06:15.159 --> 00:06:20.319
More dangerously, as more pages appear in
the book, the events of the Daeva empire are

00:06:20.319 --> 00:06:24.460
moving closer to the present day - with them
currently appearing in the book as having

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.319
existed until 270 CE.

00:06:26.319 --> 00:06:32.909
The Daevas were a bloodthirsty, brutal race
of warriors, but there was one thing even

00:06:32.909 --> 00:06:34.759
that apparently even they were afraid of…

00:06:34.759 --> 00:06:35.939
The Child.

00:06:35.939 --> 00:06:40.930
The Daevas had performed the last successful
ritual of sacrifice needed to strengthen the

00:06:40.930 --> 00:06:45.490
lock not long before their currently described
destruction, and the book contained enough

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:47.779
detail to recreate the ritual.

00:06:47.779 --> 00:06:52.339
But SCP researchers would find that performing
it would not be for the faint of heart.

00:06:52.339 --> 00:06:57.059
The ritual required three human cadavers,
not a problem for an organization that’s

00:06:57.059 --> 00:07:02.589
normal day to day operation results in the
loss of multiple lives, and the live heart

00:07:02.589 --> 00:07:03.930
of an angel.

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:08.379
The description of the ritual said that the
materials would be presented, new runes should

00:07:08.379 --> 00:07:12.990
be carved into the totems, the items would
then vanish when the ritual was completed,

00:07:12.990 --> 00:07:16.349
and the lock would somehow be renewed by this.

00:07:16.349 --> 00:07:19.499
It wasn’t much to go on, but time was running
out.

00:07:19.499 --> 00:07:24.059
The Foundation’s Department of Occult Containment
quickly sprang into action, assembling the

00:07:24.059 --> 00:07:26.479
materials and placing them in the correct
formation.

00:07:26.479 --> 00:07:31.529
While it was not safe to descend that deep
underwater to perform the ritual manually,

00:07:31.529 --> 00:07:33.360
technology could fill the role.

00:07:33.360 --> 00:07:38.969
A fleet of remotely operated submersibles
equipped with carving material would perform

00:07:38.969 --> 00:07:41.189
the ritual without any human hands needed.

00:07:41.189 --> 00:07:42.189
The submersibles descended down into the deep,
darkness of the lake and began the ritual,

00:07:42.189 --> 00:07:43.189
but midway through, disaster struck.

00:07:43.189 --> 00:07:46.719
One of the red bursts occurred midway through
the ritual, causing radiation damage to the

00:07:46.719 --> 00:07:47.839
vehicles.

00:07:47.839 --> 00:07:51.819
Runes that had been carved in the past were
also damaged, and the ritual was interrupted.

00:07:51.819 --> 00:07:56.259
While it seemed like it might have been enough
to activate the site, it wasn’t perfect,

00:07:56.259 --> 00:08:00.350
and when the ritual was complete one of the
three cadavers and half of the angel heart

00:08:00.350 --> 00:08:01.879
were still present at the site.

00:08:01.879 --> 00:08:05.409
Had it been enough to satisfy the ritual and
re-seal the lock?

00:08:05.409 --> 00:08:08.149
There was nothing to do but wait and see.

00:08:08.149 --> 00:08:12.339
They wouldn’t have to wait long for their
answer, as the mysterious voice once again

00:08:12.339 --> 00:08:14.899
took over the televisions in the area.

00:08:14.899 --> 00:08:21.399
This time, its message was less friendly - “The
sacrifice did not reach the ten maws.

00:08:21.399 --> 00:08:22.399
Brace”.

00:08:22.399 --> 00:08:26.819
The Child, apparently, was not satisfied and
the lock was not sealed.

00:08:26.819 --> 00:08:30.679
Everyone feared it was too late to prevent
what was coming, and panic was starting to

00:08:30.679 --> 00:08:32.630
spread among the ranks.

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:37.340
One day, several personnel stationed at the
Qinghai Lake site broke protocol and fled.

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:42.729
None of them were ever found but one fugitive
staff member, an Agent Zenovia Marinos, left

00:08:42.729 --> 00:08:43.849
behind a note though.

00:08:43.849 --> 00:08:44.849
It read:

00:08:44.849 --> 00:08:46.910
“Do we think we can actually stop this?

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:49.750
No civilization before us wanted to fight
the Child.

00:08:49.750 --> 00:08:50.750
None of them…

00:08:50.750 --> 00:08:54.970
The sacrifices won't work anymore — it refuses
to consume them.

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.019
They aren't enough to satiate it.

00:08:57.019 --> 00:09:01.040
Once that seal breaks we'll have a world of
molten darkness and the Child will be all

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:02.860
that's left, eating.

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:03.860
Drinking…

00:09:03.860 --> 00:09:05.380
You're fools for staying.”

00:09:05.380 --> 00:09:10.300
Agent Marinos was apparently so scared, that
she had fled through a portal to an extradimensional

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:12.529
space in order to escape.

00:09:12.529 --> 00:09:16.950
There would be no point in trying to track
her even if she was still alive.

00:09:16.950 --> 00:09:20.370
But in our own dimension, time was running
out.

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:24.750
Foundation seismologists were brought to the
site and stationed outside, and began monitoring

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:28.100
the high-energy pulses coming from behind
the lock.

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:32.540
The energy was reportedly strong enough to
alter dimensions, and the pulsing red light

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:38.370
now covered the entire sealing site, growing
stronger and stronger as the totems started

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:40.589
degrading at an alarming rate.

00:09:40.589 --> 00:09:45.089
The Foundation stood on guard for whatever
was about to emerge - but no one knew if they

00:09:45.089 --> 00:09:47.910
had any chance against whatever it was.

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:51.660
On August 18th, the totems fully disintegrated.

00:09:51.660 --> 00:09:56.529
Some of the Foundation’s best military forces
gathered on the shores of the lake and waited.

00:09:56.529 --> 00:10:01.920
Ten minutes later, something massive emerged
phased out of the lock and onto the seabed.

00:10:01.920 --> 00:10:03.399
And didn’t move.

00:10:03.399 --> 00:10:08.250
The assembled Foundation forces were confused,
and continued to observe the creature and

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:13.339
after no activity was seen after three hours,
the authorization was given for submersibles

00:10:13.339 --> 00:10:19.220
and a small exploratory team to proceed down
to the sea bed for an up-close investigation.

00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:22.779
There, down on the floor of the lake, was
the Child.

00:10:22.779 --> 00:10:29.650
It was as terrifying as described, with countless
mouths and arms, and huge in size, over 40

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:30.930
meters long.

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:35.790
The signs of previous rituals were everywhere,
with angel hearts and human corpses littered

00:10:35.790 --> 00:10:38.680
around - some in the creature’s mouth.

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.829
But none of them had been eaten.

00:10:40.829 --> 00:10:46.079
The ritual had apparently been performed many
times, but to no actual purpose.

00:10:46.079 --> 00:10:51.550
The massive being was scanned many times,
but no signs of psychic energy, radiation,

00:10:51.550 --> 00:10:53.850
or other life signs were detected.

00:10:53.850 --> 00:10:55.399
The Child was dead.

00:10:55.399 --> 00:10:59.959
And it had apparently been so for a very,
very long time.

00:10:59.959 --> 00:11:03.949
Once the area had been cleared, teams were
brought in to investigate the body in person

00:11:03.949 --> 00:11:06.230
and perform an autopsy on-site.

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:11.019
No explanation of what exactly this creature
had been or what its origins were has ever

00:11:11.019 --> 00:11:14.760
been discovered, but they did get answers
for when it died.

00:11:14.760 --> 00:11:20.259
The time of death was roughly nine thousand
years ago, not long after its initial sealing.

00:11:20.259 --> 00:11:22.629
The cause of death was discovered too.

00:11:22.629 --> 00:11:27.670
The Child, the destroyer of worlds and scourge
of countless civilizations, had died from

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:29.130
malnutrition.

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:33.880
Whatever this thing had been, it had been
sealed away and had died from hunger not long

00:11:33.880 --> 00:11:35.060
after.

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:40.110
One civilization after another had continued
to perform the rituals to keep it sealed,

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:43.029
never aware that it was no longer a threat.

00:11:43.029 --> 00:11:49.270
With this new discovery, SCP-4290 was reclassified
as Neutralized, but The Child taught us all

00:11:49.270 --> 00:11:54.100
a valuable lesson about being prepared for
potential world ending scenarios, and the

00:11:54.100 --> 00:11:58.850
Foundation continues to stand on alert for
any more entities from the distant past that

00:11:58.850 --> 00:12:00.949
may pose a threat today.

00:12:00.949 --> 00:12:05.500
Because who knows what else is sealed away
at the bottom of a lake, abandoned mine, or

00:12:05.500 --> 00:12:08.040
in the ocean’s deepest trenches.

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:12.370
There might just be another existential threat
to humanity that’s just waiting for its

00:12:12.370 --> 00:12:17.899
chance to emerge, and help us all if it remembered
to pack a lunch.

00:12:17.899 --> 00:12:24.579
For more on strange rituals, go watch SCP-2317
The Devourer of Worlds and SCP-1337 - The

00:12:24.579 --> 00:12:26.209
Hitchhiker.

